    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just another way of saying we're just delaying the inevitable. if everything is just going to settle into zero energy and total stillness anyway, isn't all this struggle just... unnecessary? it feels like we're consuming energy and creating chaos just to maintain a temporary state that doesn't even matter in the long run. why keep the struggle going if the end result is always going to be nothing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
